Cell["\<\
-\\frac{a^3 z^{3/2} e^{\\frac{a^2 z^2}{16 d^2 x^4}}
   \\left(K_{\\frac{1}{4}}\\left(\\frac{a^2 z^2}{16 d^2
   x^4}\\right)-K_{\\frac{3}{4}}\\left(\\frac{a^2 z^2}{16 d^2
   x^4}\\right)\\right)}{8 x^3}\
\>", "Output",
